payload:
  status: REAL
  source: >-
    Promoted from OPEN this pass — real backing found while mapping cortex.
    cortex/self-heal/index.js's real _enterFailureMode(gapType, gapUuid, existing) ("Level 4 —
    failure mode, human action item") writes real jaaDB rows to a real `failure_modes` table, read
    back via cortex/boot.js's real GET /api/failure-modes (jaaDB.tail('failure_modes', 20)). This
